            <ArticleTitle>Monarthric ankle pain. A diagnostic challenge.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>71-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A patient presented with monarthric ankle pain, which took 2 years to diagnose by numerous physicians and imaging and laboratory tests. A review of the differential diagnosis for monarthritic joint pain with guidelines for the work-up of the patient are presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
